WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:00.002 --> 00:00:01.461
- I totally had a crush on Hans Solo,

00:00:01.461 --> 00:00:02.838
but Hans Solo was already taken.

00:00:02.838 --> 00:00:04.839
Now I just wanna watch Star Wars.

00:00:04.839 --> 00:00:06.049
In this pillow fort.

00:00:06.049 --> 00:00:07.175
Right now.

00:00:07.175 --> 00:00:09.469
- We've never made a
blanket fort together.

00:00:09.469 --> 00:00:10.626
- No, we haven't reached that point

00:00:10.626 --> 00:00:11.876
in our relationship yet.
- [Girl in black] No.

00:00:11.876 --> 00:00:13.622
- [Girl on right] This is
gonna be the best blanket fort.

00:00:13.622 --> 00:00:14.141
Ever.

00:00:14.141 --> 00:00:16.267
- My forte was umbrella forts.

00:00:16.267 --> 00:00:17.227
- Ooooh!

00:00:17.227 --> 00:00:19.146
- She's actually gonna be
the one building the fort

00:00:19.146 --> 00:00:21.147
and we're just gonna watch.

00:00:21.147 --> 00:00:23.525
- Ready, set.

00:00:23.525 --> 00:00:24.025
- [Both] Go!

00:00:24.025 --> 00:00:26.428
- No get up, get up, go!

00:00:27.698 --> 00:00:30.762
- Maybe if we just like flank either side.

00:00:30.762 --> 00:00:31.241
- [Girl on right] Yes.

00:00:31.241 --> 00:00:32.690
- We need a bunny.

00:00:34.900 --> 00:00:36.747
- Here's what I'm gonna do, Quinta.

00:00:36.747 --> 00:00:37.789
- Well, first things first.

00:00:37.789 --> 00:00:39.936
We need to make the floor cushy.

00:00:41.116 --> 00:00:42.502
- [Girl on right] I'm
putting the sheets over here.

00:00:42.502 --> 00:00:44.023
- [Girl swinging pillow] Get out!

00:00:44.023 --> 00:00:44.871
Out!

00:00:44.871 --> 00:00:46.464
- [Voiceover] How's it goin' smells?

00:00:46.464 --> 00:00:48.410
- It's good, it's good.

00:00:49.050 --> 00:00:52.096
♫ Twinkle twinkle little star ♫

00:00:52.756 --> 00:00:54.872
- It's gettin' weird quick!

00:00:54.872 --> 00:00:55.232
(glute slapping)

00:00:55.232 --> 00:00:56.433
- [Girl bent over] Ow! (laughs)

00:00:56.433 --> 00:00:57.558
- How do you sing it in Chinese?

00:00:57.558 --> 00:01:00.311
- (sings in Chinese)

00:01:00.311 --> 00:01:01.971
- Oh, that's actually really cute!

00:01:01.971 --> 00:01:02.647
- [Girl in black] I know.

00:01:02.647 --> 00:01:03.724
- [Voiceover] Anyone can join in

00:01:03.724 --> 00:01:04.649
our fort.
- [Voiceover] Anyone can join.

00:01:04.649 --> 00:01:07.360
- [Voiceover] Being an
adult sucks sometimes.

00:01:07.360 --> 00:01:08.612
- [Voiceover] She's just chillin'.

00:01:08.612 --> 00:01:10.117
You're not even helping us!

00:01:10.117 --> 00:01:12.316
- Got some whale on dog action.

00:01:12.316 --> 00:01:14.284
- [Voiceover] No one will
ever be able to find us.

00:01:14.284 --> 00:01:15.854
- [Voiceover] No one will know.

00:01:15.854 --> 00:01:17.135
- Should it just be Fort Dino?

00:01:17.135 --> 00:01:18.194
- [Voiceover] Yes.

00:01:19.134 --> 00:01:19.906
- Starlands.

00:01:19.906 --> 00:01:20.623
- [Voiceover] Starlands.

00:01:20.623 --> 00:01:22.519
Welcome to Starland.

00:01:22.519 --> 00:01:23.617
- Goodbye.

00:01:23.617 --> 00:01:25.211
- [All] Yoo hoo!

00:01:25.211 --> 00:01:27.489
(laughing)

00:01:28.339 --> 00:01:29.883
- Why don't we do this more often?

00:01:29.883 --> 00:01:31.001
- Yeah, we should.

00:01:31.001 --> 00:01:33.278
- We got hot chocolate!

00:01:33.278 --> 00:01:35.471
- Hot chocolate!
- [Girl on left] Woooow!

00:01:35.471 --> 00:01:37.207
- [Girl on right] Dude, you got like

00:01:37.207 --> 00:01:39.809
50 billion, trillion
marshmallows in there.

00:01:39.809 --> 00:01:41.143
- Oh!

00:01:41.143 --> 00:01:42.646
Did you know it's my birthday today?

00:01:42.646 --> 00:01:44.766
- I just need a really big book now.

00:01:44.766 --> 00:01:47.608
- If we lay back, we
can look at the stars.

00:01:47.608 --> 00:01:48.984
- Yeah, it's the same universe.

00:01:48.984 --> 00:01:51.112
Of course we're looking at the same stars!

00:01:51.112 --> 00:01:53.978
- Oh, we also need like
a no boys allowed sign.

00:01:53.978 --> 00:01:55.801
- What kind of noise does a octopus make?

00:01:55.801 --> 00:01:57.327
- Glug, glug, glug,
glug, glug, glug, glug.

00:01:57.327 --> 00:02:00.080
- I wanted to be exactly
what I am right now.

00:02:00.080 --> 00:02:01.323
- When I was growing up

00:02:01.323 --> 00:02:04.382
I wanted to become a NASCAR driver.

00:02:04.382 --> 00:02:06.193
- Really?
- [Girl on right] Yeah.

00:02:06.193 --> 00:02:08.087
- [Girl in middle] That
explains the way you drive.

00:02:08.087 --> 00:02:09.452
- [Voiceover] I think this makes me think

00:02:09.452 --> 00:02:12.333
maybe I take my life a
little too seriously.

00:02:12.333 --> 00:02:13.836
- [Voiceover] Same.

00:02:13.836 --> 00:02:18.669
(whimsical music)

